  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>985</x><y>60</y><w>390</w><h>150</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>run() is final and fixes the agent loop:
1. buildMessages(req)
2. llm.complete(msgs, tools, systemPrompt())
3. while tool calls and round &lt; maxToolRounds:
   execute via ToolRegistry, append results
4. output = parseFinal(response, ctx)
5. report = validate(output, ctx)
6. valid ? success : onInvalid(report, req)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
